@ExploreTravelDocspersonally love Portugal. Mainly Lisbon and Cascais. Gotten very popular. Spend around 6 months in Lisbon for work many (20) years ago. Still try to visit Lisbon or Cascais each year for a week or so.
Mainly Cascais the last few years as it’s smaller and less busy. Not cheap though unless you find a place outside the city center, shop local outside tourist places and use uber. (i use an above average amount for my holiday so you’d need to google for lower cost places).
30 min walk is a 3-5 euro uber… depending. And there are loads available (so are regular taxi’s which cost about the same, but uber comes to you simply using the app)
